# What Vercel uploads for the build. A bare name matches at EVERY depth, so `art`
# also matched public/art and stripped the waiting-room art from production builds.
# Anchored with a leading slash it only drops the 4K masters at the repo root.
/art
/public/*.mp3
/public/*.wav
/PLAN-*.md
/roadmap.md
*.avif
*.mp4
.muse
.claude
.vite
/dist
